meta.prompt_template:
You are analyzing a robotic manipulation trajectory.
Task: {task_description}

You are shown {K} keyframes from an episode that FAILED (the robot did not achieve the goal).
The frames are shown in chronological order. Frame indices map to approximate timestep fractions:
{frame_index_map}

Identify the keyframe index (0-indexed) where the robot's action MOST CLEARLY caused or revealed the failure — the critical decision point or contact failure moment.

If the failure point is ambiguous or cannot be determined from these frames, set failure_frame_index to null.

Respond with ONLY a JSON object: {{"failure_frame_index": <int or null>, "reasoning": "<one sentence>"}}
